{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>香港天文台於2026年10月24日上午7時45分發出特別天氣提示，提醒市民注意炎熱天氣可能對健康造成的影響。當前氣溫持續偏高，市民應保持警惕，避免長時間暴露於陽光下，並採取必要的防暑措施。 \n</p>\n<p>天文台建議市民多補充水分，避免飲用含酒精或高糖分的飲品，以防止脫水。此外，穿著輕便及淺色衣物有助於減少熱量吸收，並應盡量留在陰涼處或有空調的室內環境。 </p>\n<p>市民如感到頭暈、疲倦或出現其他中暑症狀，應立即尋求醫療協助。請密切留意天文台的最新天氣資訊，並採取適當的防護措施以保障自身安全。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%82%8e%e7%86%b1%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">炎熱天氣</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nOct 24 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T00:44:22.456784+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":273,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T00:30:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T01:18:41.536669+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T00:38:34.555568+00:00","content_hash":"8482d4b5d4ab48cfde6d508f7a141b61659da9166b47af79fdfe644bd0748c27","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}